	// `utils/`. Its own discriminator for `declShapeAlias`'s reason, and load-bearing for a reason NO other
	// entry in this table carries: it is the one fact keyed on a file's DIRECTORY rather than on its bytes.
	// MOVING `utils/helper.maxon` to `tools/helper.maxon` changes not one byte of any file, yet it decides
	// whether another file's `utils.helper()` resolves at all — so without this the reader's parse memo would
	// survive an edit that changes what the reader compiles to. The bare name rides through `record`; only the
	// qualified spelling can carry the directory.
