// so a name with no entry has none of them — the safe direction for all of them: an unmarked function is
// compiled as though the fact did not exist, while a wrongly MARKED one would stop emitting the edge control
// really takes, or move a box a second owner still holds. The one payload is the calls a conditional claim waits
// on. `takesReceiver` is half of the registration key.
export union SweptBodyFact
	// The body's tail is a `panic(…)` and nothing in it can return.
