	// ⭐⭐ ONE HOP: every `return` in the body hands back a record literal OR the result of a call, and
	// at least one is a call; `forwards` holds every such call, one per forwarding `return`. The claim
	// is CONDITIONAL: it becomes `returnsAFreshRecord` exactly when every declaration those calls
	// reach publishes that fact itself, which only the whole-program close can decide
	// (`ProgramSignatures.closeFreshReturnForwards`). A frame that returns a fresh record it did not
	// build still hands its caller the sole reference: it bound the value to nothing, so no statement
	// stands between the callee's hand-off and its own.
